# The development tools of the blueprint: Copier for the tests of the template, the
# tests and their properties (Hypothesis), run on every core (pytest-xdist) with their
# coverage (pytest-cov) and a time limit for each (pytest-timeout), coverage, type
# checks and lint, ShellCheck among it, which shellcheck-py brings for Linux, macOS
# and Windows, Pillow, with which the tests draw the pictures of the screenshot bot,
# and PyYAML, with which they read the workflows whose steps they run; Copier needs it
# as well, but the tests ask for it themselves. Renovate keeps this list and the
# hash-pinned requirements-dev.txt current.
copier
coverage
hypothesis
mypy
pillow
pytest
pytest-cov
pytest-timeout
pytest-xdist
pyyaml
ruff
shellcheck-py
